1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,200
Nabi persaudarakan Abdurrahman bin Auf

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,548
dengan seorang sahabat namanya Sa'd

3
00:00:05,548 --> 00:00:06,800
bin ar-Rabi'.

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,070
Dia orang kaya, ahli perniagaan,

5
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:12,280
sesuai dengan Abdurrahman ahli perniagaan.

6
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:16,710
Lalu kata Sa'd bin ar-Rabi', dia

7
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:19,710
kata, aku ada isteri.

8
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,320
Fanzur, cuba tengok,

9
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:24,600
mana satu

10
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,944
yang kamu rasa suka?

11
00:00:27,944 --> 00:00:32,400
Utalliquha, aku ceraikan, mu pilih

12
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,765
mana hak mu nak, hak orang

13
00:00:35,765 --> 00:00:37,720
nak mesti hak comel lah, mu

14
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,520
pilih, aku cerai.

15
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:41,920
Sanggup buat begitu kita?

16
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:44,940
Kita ada bini dua, nak cerai rasa?

17
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:51,970
Kenapa nak dia beri isteri?

18
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:54,430
Sebab kawan ni main seorang-seorang diri.

19
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:55,680
Tak ada isteri.

20
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,530
Tak ada isteri, ada macam-macam

21
00:00:57,530 --> 00:00:59,000
masalah akan berlaku.

22
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,350
Nak ceraikan.

23
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:02,770
Aku ada harta, aku nak agih

24
00:01:02,770 --> 00:01:03,740
pada kamu.

25
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:05,870
Kamu separuh, aku separuh.

26
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:08,960
Sahabat Nabi, nama Sa'd bin ar-Rabi'.

27
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:12,390
Tapi apa kata Abdurrahman bin Auf?

28
00:01:12,390 --> 00:01:15,930
Barakallahu laka fi ahlika wa malik.

29
00:01:15,930 --> 00:01:17,930
Moga Allah berkati kamu pada

30
00:01:17,930 --> 00:01:20,400
keluarga kamu dan harta kamu.

31
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,950
Maksudnya apa?

32
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:23,970
Dia menolak pemberian dan cadangan.

33
00:01:23,970 --> 00:01:25,950
Barakallahu laka fi ahlika wa malik.

34
00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:27,840
Dia doa agar ada barakah.

35
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:30,550
Tapi apa yang dia nak?

36
00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:33,340
Kata dia, dulluni 'alas suq,

37
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:38,166
tunjukkan pada saya mana pasar.

38
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,920
Mana pasar?

39
00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:41,380
Tunjukkan saya.

40
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:43,920
Mana pasar?

41
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,220
Nak

42
00:01:44,870 --> 00:01:46,800
tunjuk pasar kat mana?
